{"id":"torrey:hell","source":"torrey","name":"Hell","slug":"hell","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The place of disembodied spirits — Ac 2:31.","refs":[["Acts",2,31,2,31]]},{"text":"Which Christ visited. — Lu 23:43; Ac 2:31; 1Pe 3:19.","refs":[["Luke",23,43,23,43],["Acts",2,31,2,31],["1Pet",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"Contains, a place of rest, Abraham’s bosom. — Lu 16:23.","refs":[["Luke",16,23,16,23]]},{"text":"Paradise. — Lu 23:43.","refs":[["Luke",23,43,23,43]]},{"text":"And a place of torment. — Lu 16:23.","refs":[["Luke",16,23,16,23]]},{"text":"Destruction from the presence of God. — 2Th 1:9.","refs":[["2Thess",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Everlasting punishment. — Mt 25:46.","refs":[["Matt",25,46,25,46]]},{"text":"Everlasting fire. — Mt 25:41.","refs":[["Matt",25,41,25,41]]},{"text":"Everlasting burnings. — Isa 33:14.","refs":[["Isa",33,14,33,14]]},{"text":"A furnace of fire. — Mt 13:42,50.","refs":[["Matt",13,42,13,42],["Matt",13,50,13,50]]},{"text":"A lake of fire. — Re 20:15.","refs":[["Rev",20,15,20,15]]},{"text":"Fire and brimstone. — Re 14:10.","refs":[["Rev",14,10,14,10]]},{"text":"Unquenchable fire. — Mt 3:12.","refs":[["Matt",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Devouring fire. — Isa 33:14.","refs":[["Isa",33,14,33,14]]},{"text":"Prepared for the devil, & c — Mt 25:41.","refs":[["Matt",25,41,25,41]]},{"text":"Devils are confined in, until the judgment day — 2Pe 2:4; Jude 1:6.","refs":[["2Pet",2,4,2,4],["Jude",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Punishment of, is eternal — Isa 33:14; Re 20:10.","refs":[["Isa",33,14,33,14],["Rev",20,10,20,10]]},{"text":"The wicked shall be turned into — Ps 9:17.","refs":[["Ps",9,17,9,17]]},{"text":"Human power cannot preserve from — Eze 32:27.","refs":[["Ezek",32,27,32,27]]},{"text":"The body suffers in — Mt 5:29; 10:28.","refs":[["Matt",5,29,5,29],["Matt",10,28,10,28]]},{"text":"The soul suffers in — Mt 10:28.","refs":[["Matt",10,28,10,28]]},{"text":"The wise avoid — Pr 15:24.","refs":[["Prov",15,24,15,24]]},{"text":"Endeavour to keep others from — Pr 23:14; Jude